or incorrectly recorded assets, and improve asset management and accountability.</p><br><p class=\"editor-paragraph\"><b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">Who are you responsible for this review?</strong></b></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\">You are responsible for these persons below:<br>@{outputs('Compose_DelegateSection')}</p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\">Additionally, if you have been designated as a <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">Person in Charge (PIC)</strong></b> for an office location, you are <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">co-responsible</strong></b> with the <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">Asset Owner</strong></b> for <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">confirming </strong></b>the status of <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">all assets</strong></b> within your assigned location(s).</p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\"><br><b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">What is required from you?</strong></b><br>Please open the <a href=\"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-<REDACTED-ID>/a/763883f3-c82b-4355-9b89-d087884e1419?tenantId=<REDACTED-ID>&amp;hint=4805f647-beca-4ea2-bbdb-8be8ae5a7cec&amp;sourcetime=1788430178664#\" class=\"editor-link\">Power Apps link</a> provided in this email and review the list of assets shown.<br>For each asset:<br>1. Select <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">Available </strong></b>if the asset is present and the details are correct.<br>2. Select <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">Not Available</strong></b> if the asset is not currently in your possession or if the asset information is incorrect.<br>3. Use the <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">Add a comment</strong></b> field to explain any discrepancy or provide additional details.<br>4. Select <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">Save Response</strong></b> to complete your submission.<br>Please complete the confirmation for all assets assigned to you or within your responsibility. Replying to this email is <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">not sufficient</strong></b>; your confirmation must be submitted in <b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">Power Apps</strong></b>.</p><br><p class=\"editor-paragraph\"><b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">What is the timeline for this activity?</strong></b><br><b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">19 October 2026 :</strong></b> Initial notification and start of confirmation<br><b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">2 November 2026 :</strong></b> First reminder<br><b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">9 November 2026 :</strong></b> Second reminder<br><b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">17 November 2026 :</strong></b> Last reminder<br><b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">20 November 2026 :</strong></b> Submission deadline</p><br><p class=\"editor-paragraph\">Please refer to the attached tutorial for detailed instructions on how to complete the Stock Opname - In Use Review through Power Apps.<br><br><b><strong class=\"editor-text-bold\">Other Support Options:</strong></b><br>For any questions please contact <a href=\"mailto:ITGovernance@zurich.co.id\" class=\"editor-link\">@IDZ_ZAI IT Governance</a><br><br>Regards,<br>IT Governance &amp; Control Team</p>","emailMessage/From":"ITGovernance@zurich.co.id","emailMessage/Cc":"<REQUESTER-EMAIL>","emailMessage/Attachments":[{"Name":"Stock_Opname_In_Use_Tutorial.pdf","ContentBytes":"@body('Get_file_content')"}],"emailMessage/Importance":"Normal"},"host":{"apiId":"/providers/Microsoft.PowerApps/apis/shared_office365","connectionName":"shared_office365","operationId":"SendEmailV2"},"authentication":{"value":"@json(decodeBase64(triggerOutputs().headers['X-MS-APIM-Tokens']))['$ConnectionKey']","type":"Raw"}}}},"runAfter":{"Compose_Check_Email":["Succeeded"]},"else":{"actions":{}},"expression":{"and":[{"greater":["@length(body('Filter_array_1'))",0]}]},"type":"If"},"Filter_array_1":{"runAfter":{"Set_variable_1":["Succeeded"]},"type":"Query","inputs":{"from":"@body('Parse_JSON')","where":"@and(\r\n    or(\r\n        equals(item()?[